Band Description: A trio consisting of a disgruntled physicist, a former Tokyo subway graffiti writer, and a noise-purist DJ. They perform wearing industrial-grade respirators that double as microphones, and their live setup is integrated directly into the building's main power conduit, allowing the band to physically manipulate the room's lights with their synth filters.

